{
  "schemaVersion": 5,
  "id": "bodycamcraft",
  "title": "BodycamCraft",
  "tagline": "Minecraft survival filmed like bodycam footage, with Bodycam's real guns.",
  "description": "Play Minecraft survival through a chest-mounted camera: fisheye lens, grain, sway and no crosshair. Bodycam's Glock 17 and M4A1, with their models, textures and sounds, are read from your own copy of Bodycam. Free aim, recoil, magazines and reloads; craft more guns and magazines in survival. Only Minecraft runs; Bodycam is never started or changed.",
